{
    "title": "Illinois Tollway",
    "description": "Safely and securely pay unpaid tolls or enroll and manage your I-PASS account or Pay By Plate service directly from your smartphone.\r\n- Already miss a toll? No transponder? No problem. Simply add your plate, payment information for up to 14 days after your initial travel to avoid fines and fees. TIP - If you\u2019ve already traveled, be sure to backdate your plate information to reflect your beginning date of travel.\r\n-Are you an I-PASS customer, or looking to enroll? You can now enroll in or manage your account right from the Tollway\u2019s app. You\u2019ll receive account notification, and will be able to manage your entire account online. Get started today! \r\n- Renting or Borrowing a Vehicle? If you\u2019re in a rented, borrowed or temporary vehicle without an I-PASS or E-ZPass transponder, Pay By Plate is right for you. Simply enter the plate, payment and dates and times of travel within 14 days of your initial travel and you\u2019re all set.\r\n- Already a Pay By Plate customer? Login right from the app to manage your service. Simply download the app and log in today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Safely and securely pay unpaid tolls or enroll and manage your I-PASS account or Pay By Plate service directly from your smartphone.<br>- Already miss a toll? No transponder? No problem. Simply add your plate, payment information for up to 14 days after your initial travel to avoid fines and fees. TIP - If you\u2019ve already traveled, be sure to backdate your plate information to reflect your beginning date of travel.<br>-Are you an I-PASS customer, or looking to enroll? You can now enroll in or manage your account right from the Tollway\u2019s app. You\u2019ll receive account notification, and will be able to manage your entire account online. Get started today! <br>- Renting or Borrowing a Vehicle? If you\u2019re in a rented, borrowed or temporary vehicle without an I-PASS or E-ZPass transponder, Pay By Plate is right for you. Simply enter the plate, payment and dates and times of travel within 14 days of your initial travel and you\u2019re all set.<br>- Already a Pay By Plate customer? Login right from the app to manage your service. Simply download the app and log in today!",
